OL,3,GNEWSA'Cold-blooded' teens jailed for
OL,4,Arestaurant arson
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo teenagers have been jailed for 10
OL,7,Fyears for their role in an arson attack
OL,8,Fat an east London Indian restaurant in
OL,9,Fwhich diners were seriously injured.
OL,11,FThe boys, now 17, were armed with
OL,12,Fmachetes when they went into Indian
OL,13,FAroma in Gants Hill in August 2025.
OL,15,FThey held the doors shut while a third
OL,16,Fperson poured fuel around the room and
OL,17,Fset it alight.
OL,19,FThe pair - who cannot be named because
OL,20,Fof their age - had denied the charges
OL,21,Fbut were convicted of arson with intent
OL,22,Fto endanger life.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
